# Three boss encounters (synthetic, invented): the Tarnished falls to the first, wins the second, and walks away from
# the third. Our own route, names and numbers; the bars' name ids are invented.
route boss-attempts
seed 23
step 250
end 70000

at 0     spawn player hp=1000/1000 pos=0,0,0
at 0     place 62001
at 2000  spawn warden team=7 pos=12,0,0 hp=3000/3000 param=91001
at 2000  boss warden on
at 4000  hit warden -> player dmg=420
at 6000  hit warden -> player dmg=420
at 8000  kill player by=warden
at 8250  banner 5
at 9500  boss warden off
at 10000 banner none
at 10000 despawn warden
at 10500 load over=3000 revive
at 16000 spawn warden team=7 pos=12,0,0 hp=3000/3000 param=91001
at 16000 boss warden on
at 17000 hit player -> warden dmg=900
at 19000 hit player -> warden dmg=900
at 21000 hit player -> warden dmg=900
at 23000 kill warden by=player
at 23250 banner 1
at 24000 boss warden off
at 25500 banner none
at 26000 despawn warden
at 40000 place 62002
at 44000 spawn keeper team=7 pos=15,0,0 hp=2000/2000 param=91002
at 44000 boss keeper on
at 47000 move player to=-60,0,0 over=3000
at 50000 boss keeper off
at 50000 despawn keeper
at 64000 ng 1

# What the route must show (ARCH §8.5, §8.6, §9): one PlayerDied from the dead bit, the death count and banner 5;
# each fight's outcome as soon as its evidence shows, and Left only once 10 s pass without any.
expect count 1 PlayerDied killer=warden in_boss=true
expect event BossFightStarted key=boss:1 within 2000..2000
expect event Struck subject=player att=warden hard=true within 4000..4000
expect event BossFightEnded outcome=Death key=boss_end:1 within 10500..10500
expect event LoadingStarted within 10500..10500
expect event LoadingEnded within 13500..14000
expect event BossFightEnded outcome=Victory key=boss_end:2 within 25000..25000
expect event LowHp subject=warden
expect no AllyDied
expect event BossFightEnded outcome=Left key=boss_end:3 source=timer within 60000..60000
expect count 3 BossFightStarted
expect event JourneyChanged ng_lvl=1 within 64000..64000
